    "div" : "<div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Questionnaire BAASIS</b></p><a name=\"en-BAASIS\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcBAASIS\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #fbffeb; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Language: de-DE</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"https://medizininformatik-initiative.github.io/kerndatensatzmodul-proms/2027.0.0-ballot.2/StructureDefinition-mii-pr-pro-questionnaire.html\">MII PR PRO Questionnaire</a></p></div><b>Structure</b><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"xhtTableBorder1\"><tr class=\"xhtRowBorder2\"><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"The linkID for the item\">LinkID</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Text for the item\">Text</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Minimum and Maximum # of times the item can appear in the instance\">Cardinality</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"The type of the item\">Type</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Additional information about the item\">Description &amp; Constraints</a><span style=\"float: right\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Legend for this format\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"doco\" style=\"background-color: inherit\"/></a></span></th></tr><tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_q_root.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"QuestionnaireRoot\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> BAASIS</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Basel Assessment of Adherence to Immunosuppressive Medications Scale, 10 Variablen aus dem NTx-Dictionary (Kategorie TCH), Fassung Written self-report der Version 2021 mit den drei Phasen der ABC-Taxonomie: Implementierung (1A, 1B, 2, 3), Persistenz (4), Initiierung (5, 5_a). **Metadata-only:** Struktur, `linkId`s, Typen und Bedingungen sind abgebildet, Itemwortlaut und Antwortbezeichnungen bewusst nicht (Rechteinhaber Universität Basel). Kein Gesamtscore; die drei Phasen werden getrennt bewertet.</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Questionnaire</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">https://bih-cei.github.io/PCOR-MII/Questionnaire/BAASIS#0.9.0</td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"en-item.BAASIS1A\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">BAASIS / </span>BAASIS1A</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Erfasst: Auslassen einer Dosis der immunsuppressiven Medikation in den letzten 4 Wochen (Konstrukt Einnahme-Adhärenz).</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-choice\">choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Options: <a href=\"#en-opt-item.BAASIS1A\">2 options</a></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"en-item.BAASIS1A_a\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">BAASIS / </span>BAASIS1A_a</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Erfasst: Häufigkeit des Auslassens in den letzten 4 Wochen, 5 Stufen (nur bei 1A = ja).</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-choice\">choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Enable When: <span><a href=\"#en-item.BAASIS1A\">BAASIS1A</a> = Yes (SNOMED CT#373066001)</span><br/>Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-baasis-haeufigkeit-5-vs.html\">BAASIS Häufigkeit 5-stufig</a></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"en-item.BAASIS1B\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">BAASIS / </span>BAASIS1B</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Erfasst: Auslassen von zwei oder mehr aufeinanderfolgenden Dosen in den letzten 4 Wochen (nur bei 1A = ja).</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-choice\">choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Enable When: <span><a href=\"#en-item.BAASIS1A\">BAASIS1A</a> = Yes (SNOMED CT#373066001)</span><br/>Options: <a href=\"#en-opt-item.BAASIS1B\">2 options</a></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"en-item.BAASIS1B_a\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">BAASIS / </span>BAASIS1B_a</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Erfasst: Häufigkeit des mehrfachen Auslassens in Folge, 5 Stufen (nur bei 1B = ja).</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-choice\">choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Enable When: <span><a href=\"#en-item.BAASIS1B\">BAASIS1B</a> = Yes (SNOMED CT#373066001)</span><br/>Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-baasis-haeufigkeit-5-vs.html\">BAASIS Häufigkeit 5-stufig</a></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"en-item.BAASIS2\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">BAASIS / </span>BAASIS2</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Erfasst: Abweichung vom vorgesehenen Einnahmezeitpunkt um mehr als zwei Stunden in den letzten 4 Wochen (Konstrukt Timing-Adhärenz).</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-choice\">choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Options: <a href=\"#en-opt-item.BAASIS2\">2 options</a></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"en-item.BAASIS2_a\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">BAASIS / </span>BAASIS2_a</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Erfasst: Häufigkeit der Zeitabweichung in den letzten 4 Wochen, 5 Stufen als Raten-Skala (nur bei 2 = ja).</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-choice\">choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Enable When: <span><a href=\"#en-item.BAASIS2\">BAASIS2</a> = Yes (SNOMED CT#373066001)</span><br/>Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-baasis-haeufigkeit-zeit-5-vs.html\">BAASIS Häufigkeit Zeitabweichung 5-stufig</a></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"en-item.BAASIS3\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">BAASIS / </span>BAASIS3</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Erfasst: eigenmächtige Änderung der verordneten Dosis in den letzten 4 Wochen (Konstrukt Dosis-Adhärenz).</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-choice\">choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Options: <a href=\"#en-opt-item.BAASIS3\">2 options</a></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"en-item.BAASIS4\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">BAASIS / </span>BAASIS4</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Erfasst: eigenmächtiges Absetzen eines immunsuppressiven Medikaments im letzten Jahr (Konstrukt Persistenz).</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-choice\">choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Options: <a href=\"#en-opt-item.BAASIS4\">2 options</a></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"en-item.BAASIS5\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">BAASIS / </span>BAASIS5</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Erfasst: Neuverordnung eines neuen Medikaments im letzten Jahr (Eingangsfrage zur Initiierung, Item 5 seit Version 2020).</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-choice\">choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Options: <a href=\"#en-opt-item.BAASIS5\">2 options</a></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck00.png)\" id=\"en-item.BAASIS5_a\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">BAASIS / </span>BAASIS5_a</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Erfasst: Einlösen der Neuverordnung und Beginn der Einnahme (nur bei 5 = ja; Konstrukt Initiierung — „nein“ bedeutet Nicht-Initiierung).</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-choice\">choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Enable When: <span><a href=\"#en-item.BAASIS5\">BAASIS5</a> = Yes (SNOMED CT#373066001)</span><br/>Options: <a href=\"#en-opt-item.BAASIS5_a\">2 options</a></td></tr>\r\n<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"hierarchy\"><br/><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Legend for this format\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"doco\" style=\"background-color: inherit\"/> Documentation for this format</a></td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Options Sets</b></p><a name=\"en-opt-item.BAASIS1A\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for BAASIS1A </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 